<title>SINGAPORE: Noble 1996 profits up 2.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Noble 1996 profits up 2.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to 31 December 1996</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    20.26  vs    19.84</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		   10.50  vs    10.30</p>
<p>    Turnover			     677.51  vs   585.52</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest	1.09  vs     1.23</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		   8.61  vs     3.98</p>
<p>    Depreciation (expense)	     3.05  vs     2.35</p>
<p>    Associates		   (loss)  0.39  vs     0.53 (gain)</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			21.71  vs    19.81</p>
<p>    Tax					0.91  vs     0.45</p>
<p>    Minorities		   (loss)  0.015 vs     0.05 (loss)</p>
<p>Note - Hong Kong-based Noble Group markets, processes and transports industrial and agricultural materials.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
